{
    "_doc": {
        "purpose": "Undress / redress commands of the COM manager's clothing buttons (scr_panel_COMmanager ButtonValidator_UndressLayers / RedressLayers / UndressAll / FixClothes / equipSingle). One command per layer and direction: the same command runs on a whole layer or on a single item (ActionPackage_Wardrobe holds the item, like ActionPackage_ItemUse). Code picks the command by isRedress / layer / allLayers (COM_Wardrobe.Find), never by ID - items of layer None use the Outer command.",
        "acceptance": "AcceptanceCheck.permissionBonus: each entry adds its bonus when the receiver holds any of its permissions towards the doer (Follow, Intimacy_Low, Intimacy_Medium, Intimacy_High, Family), and minRate (%) floors the acceptance rate while held; not held = no bonus and the EP counts as without permission (kojo requirePermission). alwaysAccept skips the roll (redressing). Self (no receiver) is always accepted.",
        "tags": "comTags wardrobe + undress/redress + undress_<layer>/redress_<layer>: kojo and onlookers' interrupt reactions can match them. Not tagged interaction/touch/action/player on purpose - these never enter Job_CharaCOM/Job_PlayerCOM allusableCOMs, only the clothing buttons build them. allowedDuringSex lets them run inside the player's sex job.",
        "kojo": "Data/Personality/personality_default/commands/com_wardrobe.json, Data/Personality/personality_base/wardrobe.json"
    },
